# Hima - API Configuration Example
# Copy this file to .dev.vars and fill in your actual API keys
# The app supports multiple LLM providers; you can use any of them

# Anthropic (Claude models)
# Get your key from: https://console.anthropic.com/
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# OpenAI (GPT models)
# Get your key from: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# Google (Gemini models)
# Get your key from: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=AIza...

# OpenRouter (Access to 200+ models including Claude, GPT, Llama, etc.)
# Get your key from: https://openrouter.ai/keys
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...

# Priority Order (for automatic fallback):
# 1. Anthropic
# 2. OpenRouter
# 3. OpenAI
# 4. Google

# Usage:
# - Set at least ONE of the above API keys
# - The app will automatically detect and use the first available key
# - You can override the provider in the UI settings or via API request body
